rule fall_through v1
description "A rule whose Go package, its name in lower case without the underscores, is fallthrough, a keyword of Go's"

inputs
  qty : number  range >=0 <=10

outputs
  fee : money[USD]  round down(1USD)

table fee_by_qty
policy unique
| qty | -> fee |
| <=5 | 3USD   |
| >5  | 2USD   |
